Package: axon-nvidia
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Axon OS <axon-os@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: linux-modules-nvidia-595-open-generic, nvidia-kernel-common-595, libnvidia-gl-595, libnvidia-gl-595:i386, libnvidia-compute-595, libnvidia-extra-595, libnvidia-decode-595, libnvidia-encode-595, libnvidia-fbc1-595, libnvidia-cfg1-595, nvidia-utils-595, nvidia-compute-utils-595, xserver-xorg-video-nvidia-595
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ProjectDEV-git/Axon-OS
Description: NVIDIA driver for Axon OS (GTX 16-series, RTX and newer)
 The NVIDIA 595 driver with the open kernel modules, as Ubuntu's prebuilt
 and signed packages, so it loads with Secure Boot on and needs no compiler
 on the machine. Includes the 32-bit OpenGL libraries Steam needs. Cards
 older than the GTX 16-series are not supported by the open modules; use the
 Standard edition and install the driver from Game Center.
